# ─── Logs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# No bare "logs" entry here on purpose — it previously matched any directory
# named "logs" anywhere under this app, including src/pages/logs (the Logs
# page's source folder), not just runtime log output. *.log below already
# covers every actual log file.
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ─── Dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules
.pnp
.pnp.js

# ─── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist
dist-ssr
*.tsbuildinfo
*.local
.vite

# ─── Test / coverage ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage

# ─── Environment (never commit real secrets) ──────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─── Editor / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
